# The carrier phrasings that used to live in search_wordnet.intent.
# They are NOT intent lines: the intent is only for sentences that name
# WordNet. They are kept here so the fallback and the common query can
# strip the carrier and look up the term alone, because the engine answers
# 'stoic' and answers nothing for 'define stoic'.
define {word}
describe {word}
what does {word} mean
what does {word} stand for
what is a {word}
what is the (definition|meaning) of {word}
(definition|meaning) of {word}
what is the (synonym|antonym|opposite) of {word}
(synonym|synonyms|antonym|antonyms|opposite|opposites) of {word}
